"╭ ╭ Keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮─╮"
"│ │ Everywhere                                    Everywhere (continued)                         │ │"
"│ │  Tab         Next pane                         Ctrl-Z      Suspend to the shell              │ │"
"│▌│  Shift-Tab   Previous pane                     Ctrl-Q      Quit                              │ │"
"│ │  Alt-←       Go to the room list              Room list                                      │ │"
"│ │  Alt-→       Go back to the chat               ↑           Previous room                     │ │"
"│ │  Alt-↑       Go to the messages                ↓           Next room                         │ │"
"│ │  Alt-↓       Go to the composer                Enter       Open room and start typing        │ │"
"│ │  Alt-1       Room list                         ?           This help                         │ │"
"│ │  Alt-2       Messages                         Messages                                       │ │"
"│ │  Alt-3       Composer                          ↑           Select older message              │ │"
"│ │  Alt-R       Filter rooms                      ↓           Newer message, then composer      │ │"
"│ │  PgUp        Scroll messages up                Enter       Reply to selected message         │ │"
"│ │  PgDn        Scroll messages down              e           Edit (own messages)               │ │"
"│ │  Esc         Close, cancel or go back          r           React with an emoji               │ │"
"│ │  Alt-E       Emoji picker                      Del         Delete (own messages)             │ │"
"│ │  Alt-A       Attach a file                     c           Copy text                         │ │"
"│ │  F1          This help                         s           Save file or picture              │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-↑      Previous room                     v           View picture                      │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-↓      Next room                         o           Open link, picture or file        │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-F      Find in this room                 t           Open the message's thread         │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-G      Search all rooms                  p           Go to replied message             │ │"
"│ │  Alt-S       Next space (then all rooms)       m           Menu for the message              │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-K      Find a room                       End         Jump to newest                    │ │"
"│ │  F2          Settings                          ?           This help                         │ │"
"│ │  F3          Next theme                       Composer                                       │─╯"
"│ │  Ctrl-P      Command palette                   Enter       Send                              │─╮"
"│ │  Ctrl-N      New chat or room…                 Shift-Enter Line break                        │ │"
"╰─│  F4          Room info and members             Alt-Enter   Line break (fallback)             │─╯"
